  "body": "The [ElementTiming](https://github.com/WICG/element-timing) API would like to use naturalWith and naturalHeight for images, in a way consistent with how it is defined in the HTML spec for img elements. Would it be possible to encapsulate the algorithm to compute these values into an algorithm so that ElementTiming can hook into it instead of linking directly into the img element attribute getters?",
